OL,3,GNEWSAAmateur historian explores
OL,4,Acounty's forgotten forts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur historian who uncovers lost
OL,7,Fbuildings and landmarks in a county
OL,8,Fsaid people were often surprised to
OL,9,Fdiscover what once stood in their
OL,10,Fneighbourhoods.
OL,12,FStephen Mudie, from Peterborough,
OL,13,Frecently shared on social media the
OL,14,Fstory of three forts that were built in
OL,15,Fthe 1600s, including one sconce in
OL,16,FMarch, Cambridgeshire.
OL,18,F"A sconce is a type of fort built of
OL,19,Fearth and timber. A great number were
OL,20,Fbuilt during the English Civil War and
OL,21,Fthe one in March dates from around
OL,22,F1643," Mudie said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
